  "logic_review": {
    "ImbalancedChen.P4AOriginalFirstFailureH3Literal": "The h3 raised branch simplifies while ActualH3Guard h is available, then uses the unchanged guard witness hparent and StrictH3.improved. Outside branch still inherits the same actual sixth cap. No new source-to-semantic assertion is introduced.",
    "ImbalancedChen.P4AOriginalSeed7Unequal15Literal": "Seed7 uses the same reorder. Unequal finite supremum still ranges over exact15 cells. le_sup' is applied to the original .nine0 witness; if_pos h is normalized in hle before destructing h, making its lower endpoint newCap(.nine0). hcap.trans himp.le then composes into that same supremum. The original unequalRaised nonempty proof can differ only as a proof argument; proof irrelevance applies. False branch and all ties/guards remain unchanged."
